==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* [[áttján]] {{qualifier|archaic}}

===Etymology===
Cognate with the Swedish {{term|aderton|lang=sv}}, Danish {{term|atten|lang=da}}, English {{term|eighteen|lang=en}} and German {{term|achtzehn|lang=de}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''átján''' {{indecl}}

# '''[[eighteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[sautján#Icelandic|sautján]] and before [[nítján#Icelandic|nítján]].

====Derived terms====
* [[einn af átján]]
* [[nú tekur átján yfir]], [[nú kastar átján yfir]]
* [[sjá upp á átján augum]]

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[átjándi]] {{m}}, [[átjánda]] {{f|n}}

[[Category:is:Cardinal numbers]]

